1
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Domain Expansion.</b></font>

2
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Chimera Shadow Garden.</b></font>

3
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Esoteric Technique.
Hollow Wicker Basket.</b></font>

4
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Hollow Wicker Basket
is the origin</b></font>

5
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:26,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of New Shadow Style's
"Simple Domain."</b></font>

6
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It possesses the ability
to neutralize a domain</b></font>

7
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:32,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and counter
its guaranteed-hit factor.</b></font>

8
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:34,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This won't end well for you.</b></font>

9
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[thuds]
-[gasps]</b></font>

10
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]
The "Domain Amplification"</b></font>

11
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>used by Jogo and Hanami
in Shibuya</b></font>

12
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:41,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>used a domain
capable of guaranteed-hit,</b></font>

13
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>guaranteed-kill technique.</b></font>

14
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

15
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:47,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE]
How was he able to hit me?</b></font>

16
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] But they
intentionally left a space</b></font>

17
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:51,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in their cursed techniques</b></font>

18
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:54,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so that Gojo's cursed technique
could flow into it,</b></font>

19
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:56,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>neutralizing his Limitless.</b></font>

20
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:00,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, Hollow Wicker Basket
and Simple Domain aren't capable</b></font>

21
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:02,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of neutralizing
the cursed technique.</b></font>

22
00:01:02,310 --> 00:01:04,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So instead, they work
by neutralizing the barrier</b></font>

23
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that's imbued
with cursed technique.</b></font>

24
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:09,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In this way,
the imbued technique's</b></font>

25
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:11,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>guaranteed-hit effect
is nullified.</b></font>

26
00:01:12,030 --> 00:01:13,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

27
00:01:14,450 --> 00:01:17,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] But Fushiguro's
domain is incomplete.</b></font>

28
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:20,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess that wiped
the sneer off your face.</b></font>

29
00:01:20,410 --> 00:01:22,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You damn brat!</b></font>

30
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[spits]</b></font>

31
00:01:24,210 --> 00:01:25,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]
When he transposed his domain</b></font>

32
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:27,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>onto the space of the gymnasium,</b></font>

33
00:01:27,550 --> 00:01:29,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>an unexpected consequence
happened.</b></font>

34
00:01:29,550 --> 00:01:31,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It forced his domain to close.</b></font>

35
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:34,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is not imbued
with a guaranteed-hit technique.</b></font>

36
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

37
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:38,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're acting
like you've already won!</b></font>

38
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:39,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

39
00:01:39,470 --> 00:01:41,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Now I get it.</b></font>

40
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:42,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]
Chimera Shadow Garden.</b></font>

41
00:01:42,850 --> 00:01:44,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is currently extending</b></font>

42
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:46,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fushiguro's Ten Shadows
Technique,</b></font>

43
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and as it does so,</b></font>

44
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:51,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>draws out 120%
of his latent potential.</b></font>

45
00:01:52,530 --> 00:01:54,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unfortunately for Reggie Star,</b></font>

46
00:01:54,570 --> 00:01:57,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that very imperfection
is what caught him off-guard.</b></font>

47
00:01:57,410 --> 00:01:59,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Both his clothes
and his shikigami</b></font>

48
00:01:59,370 --> 00:02:01,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>had physical forms
before striking me.</b></font>

49
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That means this barrier</b></font>

50
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:05,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>isn't imbued
with a guaranteed-hit technique.</b></font>

51
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The domain's buff
to his technique's abilities</b></font>

52
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:09,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is no joke, though.</b></font>

53
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is even worse to deal with</b></font>

54
00:02:11,380 --> 00:02:13,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than a simple
guaranteed-hit domain.</b></font>

55
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:15,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If he pulls
that elephant out here</b></font>

56
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:16,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and drenches me in water,</b></font>

57
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:19,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it'll take away
half of my options</b></font>

58
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I'll probably lose.</b></font>

59
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

60
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:27,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi grunts]</b></font>

61
00:02:28,610 --> 00:02:30,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] But, you know,</b></font>

62
00:02:30,110 --> 00:02:31,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's so like me</b></font>

63
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:34,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to make sure
that won't happen.</b></font>

64
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:37,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MEGUMI] Nue!
-[Nue screeches]</b></font>

65
00:02:37,570 --> 00:02:38,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Reggie grunts]</b></font>

66
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:43,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Too slow.</b></font>

67
00:02:44,710 --> 00:02:46,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have it figured out.</b></font>

68
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:49,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, I knew it.</b></font>

69
00:02:51,210 --> 00:02:53,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've had to reinforce my footing
with cursed energy</b></font>

70
00:02:54,010 --> 00:02:55,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to avoid getting sucked in.</b></font>

71
00:02:58,390 --> 00:02:59,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps splashing]</b></font>

72
00:03:00,810 --> 00:03:03,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because the whole bottom
of this domain</b></font>

73
00:03:03,350 --> 00:03:05,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is your shadow, right?</b></font>

74
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:08,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're able to remove
and store objects and yourself.</b></font>

75
00:03:08,610 --> 00:03:10,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's pretty convenient.</b></font>

76
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But one thing
kept nagging at me.</b></font>

77
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:15,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Why doesn't this guy have
more weapons he can use?"</b></font>

78
00:03:15,610 --> 00:03:18,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You just use that one paltry
cursed tool over and over.</b></font>

79
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:20,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe it's a low-capacity tool</b></font>

80
00:03:20,490 --> 00:03:22,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and you're trying to reserve
as much space for yourself,</b></font>

81
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>just in case you need it
for something later on.</b></font>

82
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Either that,</b></font>

83
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:29,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or you're being forced to bear
the weight of the objects</b></font>

84
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that are stored in your shadow.</b></font>

85
00:03:30,790 --> 00:03:32,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[struggling]</b></font>

86
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:36,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Sounds like
the latter was spot-on.</b></font>

87
00:03:36,090 --> 00:03:38,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now I've turned the design
of your domain against you.</b></font>

88
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:41,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With three passenger cars,</b></font>

89
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:44,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>your current weight
is approximately 2.4 tons.</b></font>

90
00:03:44,270 --> 00:03:47,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Looks like your clones
weren't able to tolerate it.</b></font>

91
00:03:47,270 --> 00:03:50,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I bet you can't even
produce your shikigami now.</b></font>

92
00:03:51,110 --> 00:03:53,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Either way, I'll just need
to keep minding</b></font>

93
00:03:53,110 --> 00:03:54,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my footing around you,</b></font>

94
00:03:54,900 --> 00:03:56,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as I keep adding weight</b></font>

95
00:03:56,740 --> 00:03:59,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until you're crushed under it.</b></font>

96
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:03,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Are you stupid or something?</b></font>

97
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if it's incomplete,</b></font>

98
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:09,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a domain is still a domain!</b></font>

99
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:12,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My shadow is everywhere!</b></font>

100
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:20,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[trumpets]</b></font>

101
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

102
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:27,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which one of us
will get crushed first?</b></font>

103
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:29,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh, Reggie?!
-[Reggie grunts]</b></font>

104
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:32,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

105
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:01,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

106
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:05,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] It is said
that a typical human</b></font>

107
00:06:05,780 --> 00:06:09,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>will lose consciousness
at five to six Gs.</b></font>

108
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:11,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>2.4 tons.</b></font>

109
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:14,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because Fushiguro
weighed only 60 kilograms,</b></font>

110
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:16,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that meant he was
currently suffering</b></font>

111
00:06:16,630 --> 00:06:19,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the equivalent of 40 Gs.</b></font>

112
00:06:20,260 --> 00:06:22,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In order to prevent his blood
from pooling in his legs</b></font>

113
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the high Gs,</b></font>

114
00:06:24,090 --> 00:06:26,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and depriving his brain
of blood flow,</b></font>

115
00:06:26,350 --> 00:06:28,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fushiguro was lowering
his posture,</b></font>

116
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:31,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and reinforcing his body
with cursed energy,</b></font>

117
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:33,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>paying special attention
to his legs.</b></font>

118
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:40,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A mature African elephant
weighs three to six tons.</b></font>

119
00:06:42,030 --> 00:06:45,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With the domain's improvement
to his technique's accuracy,</b></font>

120
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:48,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Max Elephant accurately
recreated its real weight.</b></font>

121
00:06:49,030 --> 00:06:50,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Under that weight,</b></font>

122
00:06:50,490 --> 00:06:54,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reggie Star's right fibula
and heel bone were cracking.</b></font>

123
00:06:54,370 --> 00:06:55,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Reggie groans]</b></font>

124
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:58,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Both of them
were now under enormous strain,</b></font>

125
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:01,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and faced the possibility
of being crushed to death</b></font>

126
00:07:01,550 --> 00:07:02,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at any second.</b></font>

127
00:07:02,590 --> 00:07:03,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both struggling]</b></font>

128
00:07:04,260 --> 00:07:05,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] I screwed up.</b></font>

129
00:07:06,010 --> 00:07:09,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could've won if I had kept
the trucks in reserve.</b></font>

130
00:07:09,140 --> 00:07:10,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do I do?</b></font>

131
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:13,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got splashed with some water
at the same time,</b></font>

132
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:14,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but my trump card's
still safe.</b></font>

133
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:17,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could slip into his shadow</b></font>

134
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:19,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and recreate my trump card
inside it.</b></font>

135
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:21,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That would crush him for sure.</b></font>

136
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:26,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, he's not dismissing
his domain.</b></font>

137
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:28,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But when he does decide
to dismiss it,</b></font>

138
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:30,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that means
anything still in his shadow</b></font>

139
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is going to be stuck
inside there.</b></font>

140
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What if I'm stuck
in his shadow forever?</b></font>

141
00:07:34,790 --> 00:07:36,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll be there
even after he dies!</b></font>

142
00:07:36,750 --> 00:07:39,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's it like
inside his shadow, anyway?</b></font>

143
00:07:39,210 --> 00:07:40,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It looks like a liquid,</b></font>

144
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:42,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but what if I can't
breathe in it?</b></font>

145
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:43,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can I float?</b></font>

146
00:07:43,710 --> 00:07:44,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keep fighting!</b></font>

147
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Submerging into his shadow
is too risky.</b></font>

148
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:48,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah, I'm out of time.</b></font>

149
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:51,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So while stuck in this state,</b></font>

150
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:53,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to pull out my trump card</b></font>

151
00:07:53,850 --> 00:07:55,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and activate it!</b></font>

152
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:57,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

153
00:07:57,850 --> 00:07:58,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

154
00:07:59,650 --> 00:08:02,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Contractual Re-Creation!</b></font>

155
00:08:05,150 --> 00:08:09,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi struggling]</b></font>

156
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[straining]</b></font>

157
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE]
I didn't make it in time.</b></font>

158
00:08:24,590 --> 00:08:27,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And now I know there's no oxygen
inside of his shadow.</b></font>

159
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No buoyancy</b></font>

160
00:08:30,220 --> 00:08:31,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or resistance, either.</b></font>

161
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:35,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm just...</b></font>

162
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:38,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>sinking.</b></font>

163
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:41,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My consciousness...</b></font>

164
00:08:42,110 --> 00:08:44,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is fading.</b></font>

165
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi groans] Not yet.</b></font>

166
00:08:49,860 --> 00:08:51,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keep enduring it.</b></font>

167
00:08:51,530 --> 00:08:53,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gotta wait until
I'm sure he's dead</b></font>

168
00:08:53,410 --> 00:08:55,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before dismissing the domain!</b></font>

169
00:08:55,370 --> 00:08:57,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I can expel
whatever's in my shadow.</b></font>

170
00:08:57,910 --> 00:09:01,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[straining]</b></font>

171
00:09:24,190 --> 00:09:26,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps, coughs]</b></font>

172
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:28,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[coughing]</b></font>

173
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:32,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] The things I recreate,</b></font>

174
00:09:32,860 --> 00:09:34,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they disappear
soon after carrying out</b></font>

175
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:36,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>whatever command
I gave them to carry out.</b></font>

176
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:40,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, I didn't give
those cars I sank any commands.</b></font>

177
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:43,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all, I didn't want them
disappearing on me.</b></font>

178
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:46,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That means I could still issue
them a command if I want.</b></font>

179
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:48,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something like
"Take me and rise up."</b></font>

180
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:50,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The weight
of one car is gone now,</b></font>

181
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:53,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it was totally worth it
to save my life.</b></font>

182
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:55,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi straining]</b></font>

183
00:09:57,890 --> 00:09:59,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Tell you what!</b></font>

184
00:09:59,390 --> 00:10:02,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am man enough to admit it!</b></font>

185
00:10:02,060 --> 00:10:03,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are strong.</b></font>

186
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:06,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But not as strong as me!</b></font>

187
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:10,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Contractual Re-Creation!</b></font>

188
00:10:10,690 --> 00:10:12,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ tense music playing]</b></font>

189
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:21,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A 132-square-foot, two-story
wooden frame structure!</b></font>

190
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:24,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The framework alone weighs
at least 30 tons!</b></font>

191
00:10:24,830 --> 00:10:27,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I'm commanding it
to crush you!</b></font>

192
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[screams]</b></font>

193
00:10:51,190 --> 00:10:53,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi straining]</b></font>

194
00:10:54,150 --> 00:10:55,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[music ends]</b></font>

195
00:10:59,490 --> 00:11:02,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Reggie gasps] What happened?</b></font>

196
00:11:02,870 --> 00:11:06,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did I fall back
into his shadow again?</b></font>

197
00:11:06,870 --> 00:11:09,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No! I'm in actual water.</b></font>

198
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:10,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How?</b></font>

199
00:11:11,250 --> 00:11:12,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's heavy.</b></font>

200
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:15,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's the brat trying to do,
strangle me?</b></font>

201
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:17,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What power!</b></font>

202
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No. That's wrong.</b></font>

203
00:11:19,470 --> 00:11:22,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is from the weight
of those two cars that I added.</b></font>

204
00:11:22,850 --> 00:11:24,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is bad.</b></font>

205
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:27,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This time, I'm really sinking!</b></font>

206
00:11:27,770 --> 00:11:31,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to dismiss
Contractual Re-Creation!</b></font>

207
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:48,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

208
00:11:48,540 --> 00:11:51,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

209
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:52,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right.</b></font>

210
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The community gymnasium.</b></font>

211
00:11:54,670 --> 00:11:57,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And in the gym's basement
is a heated swimming pool.</b></font>

212
00:12:00,220 --> 00:12:03,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did he go hiding in a shadow
and dismiss his domain?</b></font>

213
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:05,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That could ' ve forced me
to destroy the floor</b></font>

214
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and plunge into the pool.</b></font>

215
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:08,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

216
00:12:09,690 --> 00:12:11,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
You can't use your receipts</b></font>

217
00:12:11,110 --> 00:12:13,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when they're that wet, can you?</b></font>

218
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:20,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] He waited instead of
pursuing me right away.</b></font>

219
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does that mean his technique
still needs to recover</b></font>

220
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:23,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after his domain exhausted it?</b></font>

221
00:12:24,830 --> 00:12:26,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's what you think?</b></font>

222
00:12:26,370 --> 00:12:27,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you sure?</b></font>

223
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:30,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure that you can't
produce your shikigami</b></font>

224
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in your current condition.</b></font>

225
00:12:33,750 --> 00:12:34,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Yeah, that's true.</b></font>

226
00:12:35,050 --> 00:12:38,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So you do understand
what comes next, don't ya?</b></font>

227
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:42,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] He's going to use
a shikigami, just not that dog.</b></font>

228
00:12:42,930 --> 00:12:45,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But none of his other ones
can deal a decisive blow.</b></font>

229
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:47,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine. Use it!</b></font>

230
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:49,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The moment
that you let up on me,</b></font>

231
00:12:49,190 --> 00:12:51,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll finish you
with a counterattack!</b></font>

232
00:13:22,430 --> 00:13:25,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both grunting]</b></font>

233
00:13:41,570 --> 00:13:44,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You thought Demon Dog
was some weak shikigami?</b></font>

234
00:13:45,030 --> 00:13:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were wrong.</b></font>

235
00:13:47,330 --> 00:13:49,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What did I tell you before?</b></font>

236
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:51,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We sorcerers are all liars.</b></font>

237
00:13:51,250 --> 00:13:52,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[groans]
-[thuds]</b></font>

238
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:02,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ tranquil music playing,
Camille Saint-Saëns "Le Cygne"]</b></font>

239
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:10,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] The domain.</b></font>

240
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:11,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The pool.</b></font>

241
00:14:11,890 --> 00:14:13,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All to convince me</b></font>

242
00:14:13,190 --> 00:14:15,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you couldn't use
that dog anymore.</b></font>

243
00:14:16,020 --> 00:14:18,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't escape
into this gymnasium.</b></font>

244
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:20,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You lured me into it.</b></font>

245
00:14:21,740 --> 00:14:24,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To think I'd let
a modern sorcerer,</b></font>

246
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:27,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and a brat at that,
get the better of me.</b></font>

247
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:31,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nue can't fly that far
carrying me,</b></font>

248
00:14:31,950 --> 00:14:33,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I couldn't escape.</b></font>

249
00:14:33,710 --> 00:14:36,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've had trouble
with that before.</b></font>

250
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me,</b></font>

251
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how are you connected
to Tengen?</b></font>

252
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:51,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who are you talking about?</b></font>

253
00:14:51,970 --> 00:14:54,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, right, Tengen.</b></font>

254
00:14:54,890 --> 00:14:57,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That hermit
would still be alive.</b></font>

255
00:14:57,980 --> 00:15:00,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Must be history's
greatest shut-in.</b></font>

256
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay. That's enough.</b></font>

257
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:05,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reggie said Tengen's claims</b></font>

258
00:15:05,780 --> 00:15:07,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about the Culling Game
were a bluff.</b></font>

259
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd be smart
to consider the possibility</b></font>

260
00:15:11,330 --> 00:15:14,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tengen and Kenjaku
are secretly connected,</b></font>

261
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:16,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and that they're both lying
about their endgames.</b></font>

262
00:15:17,210 --> 00:15:20,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that doesn't seem likely
from Reggie's reaction.</b></font>

263
00:15:23,420 --> 00:15:24,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kogane,</b></font>

264
00:15:25,090 --> 00:15:29,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>transfer all my points over
to this little brat.</b></font>

265
00:15:29,140 --> 00:15:30,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] Okay.</b></font>

266
00:15:31,890 --> 00:15:33,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Congratulations,</b></font>

267
00:15:33,220 --> 00:15:36,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you have been granted 41 points
by Reggie Star.</b></font>

268
00:15:36,310 --> 00:15:37,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And in return?</b></font>

269
00:15:38,350 --> 00:15:41,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Must you assume
I have some evil plot?</b></font>

270
00:15:41,110 --> 00:15:44,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to do at least
one good deed before I die.</b></font>

271
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:47,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>By the way,
I'm just a spectator here.</b></font>

272
00:15:47,570 --> 00:15:50,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kenjaku and I weren't
ever close friends.</b></font>

273
00:15:50,780 --> 00:15:52,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I do like this game.</b></font>

274
00:15:52,290 --> 00:15:54,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It certainly
makes things interesting.</b></font>

275
00:15:54,910 --> 00:15:57,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's my intuition anyway.</b></font>

276
00:15:58,420 --> 00:16:00,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now do me a favor.</b></font>

277
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:02,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all, you did kill me.</b></font>

278
00:16:03,710 --> 00:16:05,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The favor is,</b></font>

279
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>let fate toy with you</b></font>

280
00:16:07,970 --> 00:16:10,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before you die like a fool.</b></font>

281
00:16:10,260 --> 00:16:13,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

282
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:36,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] You have gained
five points for a kill.</b></font>

283
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

284
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:42,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sips, grunts]</b></font>

285
00:16:49,050 --> 00:16:50,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got him!</b></font>

286
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nope! 'Cause you
dropped your guard!</b></font>

287
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:55,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think you're Mr. Tough Guy?</b></font>

288
00:16:55,770 --> 00:16:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What the hell!</b></font>

289
00:16:57,270 --> 00:16:59,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh! Why is your whole body
covered in lotion?</b></font>

290
00:16:59,890 --> 00:17:01,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It might actually be sauce.</b></font>

291
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:03,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just die!</b></font>

292
00:17:03,690 --> 00:17:05,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

293
00:17:05,230 --> 00:17:07,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I pray it's only sauce!</b></font>

294
00:17:07,530 --> 00:17:09,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seriously, what's with this guy?</b></font>

295
00:17:09,530 --> 00:17:10,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've blown him up a lot!</b></font>

296
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:14,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel like I've killed him
at least five times.</b></font>

297
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:17,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So how come he has
so little damage?</b></font>

298
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:19,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's wrong with sauce?</b></font>

299
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:23,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[IORI] Even his giant
head wound has healed up.</b></font>

300
00:17:23,630 --> 00:17:25,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But he hasn't shown any signs</b></font>

301
00:17:25,090 --> 00:17:27,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of using
reverse cursed techniques</b></font>

302
00:17:27,050 --> 00:17:28,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like I do.</b></font>

303
00:17:28,550 --> 00:17:30,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't get
what's going on with him.</b></font>

304
00:17:30,930 --> 00:17:32,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Player Hazenoki.</b></font>

305
00:17:32,430 --> 00:17:33,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What'd you want?</b></font>

306
00:17:33,590 --> 00:17:34,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I regret to inform you</b></font>

307
00:17:34,930 --> 00:17:36,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that player Reggie Star
has just died.</b></font>

308
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:38,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

309
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exclaims] Where you goin'?</b></font>

310
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:43,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[IORI] I'm goin' home.</b></font>

311
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:44,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sick of this.</b></font>

312
00:17:44,810 --> 00:17:46,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKABA] Oh. Well, take a bath!</b></font>

313
00:17:46,770 --> 00:17:48,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And brush your teeth!</b></font>

314
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:50,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

315
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:54,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey! How about
giving me your points?</b></font>

316
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:55,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't follow me.</b></font>

317
00:17:55,620 --> 00:17:56,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, come on!</b></font>

318
00:17:56,830 --> 00:17:59,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just think of it
as paying it forward.</b></font>

319
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:00,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just die.</b></font>

320
00:18:00,540 --> 00:18:02,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Takaba's
cursed technique, Comedian,</b></font>

321
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:05,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>takes whatever he's convinced
would be funny,</b></font>

322
00:18:05,380 --> 00:18:07,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and turns it into a reality.</b></font>

323
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:11,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even Satoru Gojo is incapable
of opposing this technique.</b></font>

324
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:18,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet Takaba is utterly clueless
as to how his technique works.</b></font>

325
00:18:18,890 --> 00:18:21,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Remi panting]</b></font>

326
00:18:26,770 --> 00:18:28,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
I don't get it, I don't get it!</b></font>

327
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:32,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ever since I became an adult,
I hardly understand anything.</b></font>

328
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:35,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

329
00:18:37,830 --> 00:18:40,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've heard that all men
are actually wolves.</b></font>

330
00:18:40,620 --> 00:18:41,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's always those wolves</b></font>

331
00:18:41,870 --> 00:18:44,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who take care of
the confusing stuff for me.</b></font>

332
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a win-win situation.</b></font>

333
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:52,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The wolves love being in charge,</b></font>

334
00:18:52,470 --> 00:18:54,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I love not thinking
about anything.</b></font>

335
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:57,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Men always want to do stuff
for me because I'm so cute.</b></font>

336
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:04,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

337
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:07,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The wolves
will always, always--</b></font>

338
00:19:07,770 --> 00:19:10,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[snarls]
-[gasps]</b></font>

339
00:19:16,490 --> 00:19:18,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TSUMIKI] Megumi, don't.</b></font>

340
00:19:25,620 --> 00:19:27,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] You're not killing me?</b></font>

341
00:19:27,710 --> 00:19:29,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps receding]</b></font>

342
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:36,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Damn it, sis.</b></font>

343
00:19:38,090 --> 00:19:39,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

344
00:19:40,350 --> 00:19:42,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shut up already.</b></font>

345
00:19:49,770 --> 00:19:52,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ ethereal music playing]</b></font>

346
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:05,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Events progressed
quickly in the Sendai Colony,</b></font>

347
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:06,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>far outstripping those of Tokyo.</b></font>

348
00:20:07,170 --> 00:20:10,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They also started
to become increasingly fierce.</b></font>

349
00:20:12,380 --> 00:20:14,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Dhruv Lakdawalla.</b></font>

350
00:20:14,090 --> 00:20:16,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Current points, 91.</b></font>

351
00:20:16,590 --> 00:20:18,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is his second incarnation.</b></font>

352
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:22,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's an old man
who single-handedly</b></font>

353
00:20:22,180 --> 00:20:25,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>conquered this archipelago
during the Civil War of Wa.</b></font>

354
00:20:25,850 --> 00:20:28,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He possesses
two autonomous shikigami,</b></font>

355
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:32,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the orbit of those shikigami
determines his domain.</b></font>

356
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:37,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ryu Ishigori.</b></font>

357
00:20:37,110 --> 00:20:39,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Current points, 77.</b></font>

358
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:42,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He has the greatest
cursed energy firepower</b></font>

359
00:20:42,620 --> 00:20:45,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>among any other remaining
player in the game.</b></font>

360
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:48,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Takako Uro.</b></font>

361
00:20:48,330 --> 00:20:50,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Current points, 70.</b></font>

362
00:20:50,330 --> 00:20:52,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She was originally the captain</b></font>

363
00:20:52,090 --> 00:20:54,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of the Sun, Moon,
and Stars Squad.</b></font>

364
00:20:54,550 --> 00:20:56,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Assassins for the Fujiwara Clan.</b></font>

365
00:20:57,130 --> 00:21:00,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her technique can
manipulate the sky.</b></font>

366
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kurourushi.</b></font>

367
00:21:02,970 --> 00:21:05,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Current points, 54.</b></font>

368
00:21:05,510 --> 00:21:08,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A cockroach cursed spirit
that Kenjaku freed</b></font>

369
00:21:08,730 --> 00:21:11,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the control
of cursed spirit manipulation.</b></font>

370
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:15,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It ranks as a previously
registered special-grade.</b></font>

371
00:21:16,940 --> 00:21:18,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's currently lying dormant</b></font>

372
00:21:18,650 --> 00:21:20,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until certain conditions
are met.</b></font>

373
00:21:22,120 --> 00:21:24,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There was no alliance
between them,</b></font>

374
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:27,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but their complex compatibility
and opposing strength</b></font>

375
00:21:27,580 --> 00:21:30,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>led them into
a four-way stalemate.</b></font>

376
00:21:30,750 --> 00:21:33,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But one of those pillars...</b></font>

377
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:34,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[slashes]</b></font>

378
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:36,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>...has fallen.</b></font>

379
00:21:37,300 --> 00:21:39,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuta Okkotsu.</b></font>

380
00:21:39,220 --> 00:21:41,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Current points, 35.</b></font>

381
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:43,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Three months
after the Night Parade</b></font>

382
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:44,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of a Hundred Demons,</b></font>

383
00:21:45,010 --> 00:21:47,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he blossomed
as a special-grade sorcerer.</b></font>

384
00:21:47,810 --> 00:21:49,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He is a modern sorcerer,</b></font>

385
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:51,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>rivaling the abilities
of even...</b></font>

386
00:21:51,770 --> 00:21:54,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Satoru Gojo.</b></font>

387
00:21:55,310 --> 00:21:57,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

388
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:28,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I'll obtain
400 points on my own.</b></font>

389
00:23:28,410 --> 00:23:30,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RIKA] Which would
you like, Yuta?</b></font>

390
00:23:30,370 --> 00:23:31,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE]
It's called Kurourushi!</b></font>

391
00:23:31,870 --> 00:23:34,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUTA] I'll take it all!
-[RIKA] Give me back Yuta!</b></font>

392
00:23:34,870 --> 00:23:38,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I refuse to let you
kill your best friend twice.</b></font>

